{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_10-34-numerical-methods-applied-to-chemi_exams","fact_refs":[1,2],"question":"What level and department is MIT's 10.34 course associated with?","answer":"It is a graduate-level course offered by the Chemical Engineering department."}
