{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_10-34-numerical-methods-applied-to-chemi_syllabus","fact_refs":[0],"question":"How many lecture sessions per week does 10.34 have, and how long is each session?","answer":"There are three lecture sessions per week, each lasting one hour."}
