{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_10-37-chemical-and-biological-reaction-e_assignments","fact_refs":[2],"question":"What correction was noted for the reactor pipe length in problem set 8's problem 11-5?","answer":"The reactor pipe length should be 20 cm, not 20 m as stated in the problem."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d1_10-37-chemical-and-biological-reaction-e_assignments","fact_refs":[3],"question":"In problem set 8, what viscosity values are given for hydrogen, cyclohexane, and benzene at 500°C?","answer":"Hydrogen has a viscosity of 0.015 centipoise, while cyclohexane and benzene each have a viscosity of 0.1 centipoise."}
